    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jonah Flees From the",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The word of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JON.1.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JON.1.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "came to Jonah son of Amittai:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Go to the great city of Nineveh and preach against it, because its wickedness has come up before me.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But Jonah ran away from the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JON.1.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JON.1.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and headed for Tarshish. He went down to Joppa, where he found a ship bound for that port. After paying the fare, he went aboard and sailed for Tarshish to flee from the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JON.1.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JON.1.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JON.1.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JON.1.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sent a great wind on the sea, and such a violent storm arose that the ship threatened to break up.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All the sailors were afraid and each cried out to his own god. And they threw the cargo into the sea to lighten the ship.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "JON 1:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "But Jonah had gone below deck, where he lay down and fell into a deep sleep.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The captain went to him and said, \"How can you sleep? Get up and call on your god! Maybe he will take notice of us so that we will not perish.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the sailors said to each other, \"Come, let us cast lots to find out who is responsible for this calamity.\" They cast lots and the lot fell on Jonah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So they asked him, \"Tell us, who is responsible for making all this trouble for us? What kind of work do you do? Where do you come from? What is your country? From what people are you?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He answered, \"I am a Hebrew and I worship the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JON.1.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JON.1.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of heaven, who made the sea and the dry land.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This terrified them and they asked, \"What have you done?\" (They knew he was running away from the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JON.1.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JON.1.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", because he had already told them so.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sea was getting rougher and rougher. So they asked him, \"What should we do to you to make the sea calm down for us?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Pick me up and throw me into the sea,\" he replied, \"and it will become calm. I know that it is my fault that this great storm has come upon you.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Instead, the men did their best to row back to land. But they could not, for the sea grew even wilder than before.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then they cried out to the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JON.1.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JON.1.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", \"Please,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JON.1.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JON.1.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", do not let us die for taking this man's life. Do not hold us accountable for killing an innocent man, for you,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JON.1.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JON.1.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", have done as you pleased.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then they took Jonah and threw him overboard, and the raging sea grew calm.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "At this the men greatly feared the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JON.1.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JON.1.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and they offered a sacrifice to the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JON.1.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JON.1.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and made vows to him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jonah's Prayer",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JON.1.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JON.2.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "provided a huge fish to swallow Jonah, and Jonah was in the belly of the fish three days and three nights.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.2.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
